<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
  <packageId>mandrake.rut.patches</packageId>
  <name>RimUtinni Patches (Jawa campaign)</name>
  <author>mandrake</author>
  <description>The Utinni campaign patch layer: factions, scenario, doctrine, Ash'karr worldbuilding patches. Split 2026-09-04 from Jawa Patches (mandrake.jawa.patches) per JAWA_PATCHES_SPLIT_1; tiers per infrastructure/state/jawa_patches_split_map.csv, owner-confirmed 2026-09-01. Every patch is MayRequire/Conditional-guarded. LOAD LAST of the three patch tiers, after every mod it touches.

  GEOTHERMAL_DENSITY_FIELD_1 (2026-09-09) is the one exception to patch-only:
  ships a small C# assembly (Source/GeothermalDensityField.cs) that swaps
  vanilla's SteamGeysers GenStepDef onto a GenStep_ScatterGeysers subclass
  gating geyser count by a per-tile world-position density field, reusing
  mandrake.rm.weathersuite's arc-from-substellar-point formula — hence the
  new hard dependency on that mod (and loadAfter mandrake.rut.weathersuite
  for the actual Ash'karr PlanetGeometryDef data).</description>
  <supportedVersions>
    <li>1.6</li>
  </supportedVersions>
  <modDependencies>
    <li>
      <packageId>Ludeon.RimWorld</packageId>
      <displayName>RimWorld</displayName>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>mandrake.rm.weathersuite</packageId>
      <displayName>RimMandrake: SW — Weather Suite</displayName>
    </li>
  </modDependencies>
